sequenceDiagram
  actor Creator
  participant UI as React
  participant API as Django
  participant DB as Database
  participant ML as Local services
  actor Reviewer
  Creator->>UI: Save post and upload image
  UI->>API: Authenticated CSRF-protected requests
  API->>DB: Persist tenant-scoped draft and media
  Creator->>UI: Analyze
  UI->>API: POST analyze
  API->>DB: Lock draft; set analyzing within transaction
  API->>ML: Palette, tags, sourced risk
  ML-->>API: Results and coverage limitations
  API->>DB: Store results; return to draft
  API-->>UI: Analysis JSON
  Creator->>API: Submit for review
  Reviewer->>API: Approve with comments
  API->>DB: Independent-review check and approval log
  Reviewer->>API: Mark ready
  API-->>Reviewer: READY_TO_PUBLISH
